	<digest>
		8-band TPT EQ with message rate control of all parameters
	</digest>
	<description>
		<b>evi.eq8~</b> is a 'max define' for the <o>evi_eq8</o>.gendsp gen~ abstraction.
		Because evi.eq8~ is a 'max define' it also accepts all messages and attributes that a <o>gen~</o> object does. <br />
		<br />
		An 8-band parametric EQ made up of 8 TPT SVF EQ filters, each with selectable filter type. Parameter changes can optionally be smoothed. <o>evi.eq8~</o> uses the same filter DSP and offers the same filter types as Ableton 'EQ8'. <br />
	</description>
